#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:2
msgid "SDK服务端部署及启动"
msgstr "SDK Server Deployment and Startup"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:8
msgid "SDK服务端升级"
msgstr "SDKServer Upgrade"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:10
msgid "**Step1**：将SDK服务端升级文件复制到控制器内，并解压得到升级包和升级脚本。"
msgstr ""
"**Step1**: Copy the SDK server upgrade file to the controller, and extract "
"it to get the upgrade package and upgrade script."

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:-1
msgid "001.png"
msgstr "001.png"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:17
msgid "图表 1-1 FAIRINO_ARTSDK升级文件内容"
msgstr "Chart 1-1 FAIRINO_ARTSDKUpgrade File Content"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:18
msgid "**Step2**：打开终端，执行升级脚本，输入参数(升级包路径)。"
msgstr ""
"**Step2**: Open the terminal, execute the upgrade script, input parameter ( "
"upgrade package path )."

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:-1
msgid "002.png"
msgstr "002.png"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:25
msgid "图表 1-2 SDK服务端升级"
msgstr "图表 1-2 SDKserver upgrade"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Step3**：执行sudo nano "
"/etc/systemd/system/fairino_sdk.service，修改SDK服务端自启动脚本中的域和DDS的设置，最后重启机器人。"
msgstr ""
"**Step3**: Execute sudo nano /etc/systemd/system/fairino_sdk.service, modify"
" the domain and DDS settings in the SDK service auto-start script, and "
"finally restart the robot."

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:-1
msgid "003.png"
msgstr "003.png"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:33
msgid "图表 1-3 SDK Server启动域和DDS设置"
msgstr "chart 1-3 SDK Server launch domain and DDS settings"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:34
msgid "V3.0.4版本 SDK服务端建议使用升级脚本进行升级SDK服务端，以确保SDK服务端开机自启动功能正常运行。"
msgstr ""
"V3.0.4version SDKserver is recommended to use the upgrade script for "
"upgradingSDKserver, to ensure that theSDKserver auto-start function operates"
" normally."

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:37
msgid "SDK服务端启动"
msgstr "SDK server startup"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:39
msgid ""
"v3.0.4版本 SDK服务端采用开机自启动的方式，在关节没有报错的前提下50S内SDK服务端会完成启动。可以通过如下指令查看SDK服务端日志信息。"
msgstr ""
"v3.0.4version SDKserver adopts an auto-start on boot method, under the "
"premise that there are no errors in the joints, the50Sserver will complete "
"the startup withinSDK. You can check theSDKserver log information through "
"the following command."

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:-1
msgid "005.png"
msgstr "005.png"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:46
msgid "图表 1-4 SDK Server日志"
msgstr "图表 1-4 SDK Serverlog"

#: ../../source/SDKManual/sdk_begin.rst:47
msgid "若开机SDK服务端启动后，机器人没有正常使能，请使用FAIRINO_ARTPlugin插件工具查看机器人关节驱动器是否故障码。"
msgstr ""
"If after turning on, the SDK server starts but the robot does not enable "
"normally, please use the FAIRINO_ARTPlugin plugin tool to check if there is "
"a fault code in the robot's joint drivers."

#~ msgid "**Step1**：SDK服务端在启动之前，需要确定FAIRINO_ARTPlugin插件是否启动成功。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Step 1**: Before the SDK server starts, it must verify whether the "
#~ "FAIRINO_ARTPlugin has started successfully."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Step2**：进入SDK包解压缩目录中，比如控制器默认部署路径是home/fairino/ros2_ws，找到如下文件runSDKServer.sh，并执行。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Step 2**: Navigate to the SDK package’s decompressed directory—for "
#~ "example, the controller’s default deployment path is "
#~ "`home/fairino/ros2_ws`—locate the file `runSDKServer.sh`, and execute it."

#~ msgid "**Step3**：在该路径打开bash命令窗口，然后输入./runSDKServer.sh，执行后，出现以下界面为成功。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Step 3**: Open a Bash command window at this path, then enter "
#~ "`./runSDKServer.sh`. If the following interface appears after execution, the"
#~ " process is successful."

#~ msgid "注意事项： 1. runSDKServer.sh脚本启动之前，打开脚本查看是否设置ROS_DOMAIN_ID。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Note: 1. Before running the runSDKServer.sh script, open the script to check"
#~ " whether ROS_DOMAIN_ID is set."
